    "title": "The Disappearance of Heather Tegerdine - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago 41 year old Heather Tegerdine was last seen in Sequim, Washington on December 22, 2018. She disappeared after leaving her parent’s home to go out for a walk. Between 8:00-9:00 pm on December 22, 2018, Heather Tegerdine left her parent’s home in the 3000 block of Diamond Point Road, telling them she was going out for a walk. She does not have a cellphone, and left her coat, cigarettes, and wallet behind at home. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
